,{"start":33,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","造成的伤害提升至360% + 35% ATK，对生命值较低的目标伤害提升至600% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","입히는 대미지가 360% + 35% ATK, 고정 대미지가 600% + 60% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":41,"end":47,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":13,"end":19,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":37,"end":51,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","铁索勾魂"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","망령의 사슬"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","将攻击距离外的敌方英雄钩到自己面前。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","공격 거리 밖의 적 영웅을 자신 앞으로 끌어당긴다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身普通攻击范围内没有敌方英雄时，将远处的一名敌方英雄钩到自己面前。目标英雄在被钩的过程中，每被拖拽1格的距离便会流失3.5% + 0.5%的当前生命值，最高不超过自身攻击力的250%。该效果不会导致目标英雄被击败，且本技能优先选择最接近对称位置的敌方英雄。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","일반 공격 범위 내에 적 영웅이 없을 경우, 나라가 먼 곳에 있는 적 영웅 1명을 자신 앞으로 끌어당기고, 이 기간에 목표 영웅은 1칸 끌어당겨질 때마다 현재 HP의 3.5% + 0.5%를 손실하며, 이는 나라 자신의 최대 공격력의 250%를 초과하지 않는다. 해당 스킬은 목표 영웅을 처치할 수 없으며, 가장 가까운 대칭 위치의 적 영웅을 우선 선택한다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":63,"end":70,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":97,"end":104,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":119,"end":121,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":178,"end":180,"tooltip_key":"keyword:symmetric"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每被拖拽1格流失当前生命值的百分比提升至4% + 0.5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","1칸 끌어당겨 질 때마다 손실하는 HP 비율이 4% + 0.5%로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":28,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每被拖拽1格流失当前生命值的百分比提升至4.5% + 0.5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","1칸 끌어당겨 질 때마다 손실하는 HP 비율이 4.5% + 0.5%로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":24,"end":31,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":30,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","每被拖拽1格流失当前生命值的百分比提升至5% + 0.5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","1칸 끌어당겨 질 때마다 손실하는 HP 비율이 5% + 0.5%로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":28,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","狠厉踢踏"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","죽음의 발길질"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","击飞并击倒敌人，随后造成多次伤害。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","적을 에어본시키고 넘어뜨려 여러 번의 대미지를 입힌다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奈拉踢击面前的一名敌人，造成130% + 15% ATK伤害，将其击飞并击倒2秒，随后对其快速造成三次80% + 8% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","나라가 앞에 있는 적 1명에게 발길질하여 130% + 15% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 에어본시키며 2초간 넘어뜨린 후, 80% + 8% ATK의 대미지를 3회 입힌다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":54,"end":59,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i